### Get all contacts
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/contacts
Accept: application/json

### Get contact with valid first name
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/contacts/?first_name=Jane
Accept: application/json

### Get contact with invalid first name type
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/contacts/?first_name[]=x
Accept: application/json

### Get contact with invalid email
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/contacts/?email=invalid-email
Accept: application/json

